(
K04 ground9 (2026-10-06): group_interface_groundflow_capacity is per
unit length like the permeability: the storage C*w_i*L of each facing
pair is split over its two nodes and treated implicitly (C/dt on the
matrix), as the continuum capacity. validation-suite groundflow_interface
stopped at t = 3 (3 steps of 1): node 5 pressure 1.749998578 in the
Professional 02-08-2026 (2 - 2^(1-t): each step halves the gap to 2).
GNU before K04: 0.8146 (explicit, unweighted capacity; with the
measure-weighted permeability alone it diverged).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
groundflow_velocity
groundflow_pressure
end_initia
inertia_apply   -yes

bounda_time  0  0 2 100 2
bounda_unknown  0  -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra -pres
control_timestep  0  1 3
element  1  -quad4 1 2 3 4
element  2  -quad4 2 4 5 7
element  3  -quad4 5 6 7 8
element_group  1  0
element_group  2  10
element_group  3  20
force_gravity   0 -1
groundflow_density   1
group_groundflow_capacity  0  1
group_groundflow_capacity  20  1
group_groundflow_permeability  0  0.1 0.1
group_groundflow_permeability  20  1e-06 1e-06
group_interface  10  -yes
group_interface_groundflow_capacity  10  1
group_interface_groundflow_permeability  10  1
group_interface_groundflow_total_pressure_tension  10  0.001 5
group_type  0  -groundflow
group_type  10  -groundflow
group_type  20  -groundflow
node  1  0 0
node  2  1 0
node  3  0 1
node  4  1 1
node  5  2 0
node  6  3 0
node  7  2 1
node  8  3 1
options_convection   -no
options_mesh   -fixed_in_space -fixed_in_space
options_processors   1
options_stabilization   -static
print_filter  0  -node_dof -all -pres
node_dof  1  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  2  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  3  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  4  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  5  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  6  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  7  0 0 0 0 0
node_dof  8  0 0 0 0 0
target_item  0  -node_dof 5 -pres
target_value  0  1.75 1.e-5
end_data
